      "placeholder": "e.g. x^4",
      "hints": ["Same base, multiplying: add the powers.", "$3 + (-5) = -2$"],
      "explanation": "$x^3 \\times x^{-5} = x^{3 + (-5)} = x^{-2}$, which you could also write as $\\frac{1}{x^2}$. Both are accepted."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3-q10",
